# Fees {#fees}

The Client shall pay {{placeholder: fee, currency=EUR}} per month.

> [!DRAFTING]
> The standard fee is agreed with the partner in charge.

# Non-Solicitation {#non-solicit when=non-solicit}

Neither party shall solicit the other's employees.

# Dispute Resolution {#disputes when=forum:courts}

Disputes are resolved by the courts.

# Dispute Resolution {#disputes when=forum:arbitration}

Disputes are resolved by arbitration.

# Relief

- interim relief is available from {{choose: forum, courts="a competent court", arbitration="a competent court or an emergency arbitrator"}} {#relief-forum}
- nothing in Section {{ref: disputes}} limits this item {when=!non-solicit}
